  'pdf-built-para1' => 'PDF stands for Portable Document Format. Adobe created it in 1993 with a single clear goal: make a document look exactly the same on every device, operating system, and screen it is opened on. PDF achieves this by encoding the complete visual presentation of a document into a self-contained file. All the font data, image data, layout measurements, and colour information travel with the file.',
